# Changelog

All notable changes to the Bliss Doughnuts website will be documented here.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/). This project adheres to Semantic Versioning.

## [v1.0.0] - 2026-09-18

### Added

* Initial Bliss website structure: Home, About Us, Menu, Order, and Contact pages.
* Responsiveness Testing section in README.md with DevTools screenshots.
* Device testing evidence: Mobile (iPhone SE - 375px), Tablet (iPad Pro 13 - 1024px), and Desktop (Surface Pro 10 - 1920px).
* Responsive images implementation using `srcset` and `sizes` attributes.

### Fixed

* Fixed navigation menu stacking vertically on desktop view.
* Fixed duplicate body selectors in `style.css` causing style conflicts.
* Fixed image responsiveness on small screens.

### Changed

* Updated README.md to include requirement 3.4 — Responsiveness testing and iteration.

## [v0.1.0] - 2026-09-10

### Added

* Project proposal and initial HTML files.
* Basic CSS styling and brand colours.
* GitHub repository setup.

 [v1.1.0] - 2026-10-11

 Added

- Added a separate JavaScript file, `script.js`, to organise website functionality separately from HTML.
- Added SEO-related files, including `sitemap.xml` and `robots.txt`.
* Added page-specific titles and meta descriptions to improve search engine optimisation.
* Added and improved website documentation in `README.md`.

changed
- Improved the organisation of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript files.
- Improved the structure and consistency of the website pages.
- Updated the README to explain the website's purpose, features, file structure, and testing.
- Improved the documentation of responsive design and website testing.

[v1.1.0] - 2026-10-19

  Added 

- Added a changelog to document website development and improvements.
- Added setup instructions and explanations of the main project files.
- Added documentation for website screenshots, responsive testing, and image assets.
- Added separate website pages for Home, About Us, Menu, Enquiry, Contact, and Order.
- Added JavaScript functionality for menu searching and sorting, image enlargement, and mobile navigation.
- Added client-side form validation for enquiry, contact, and order forms.

 Changed

* Prepared the website project for GitHub version control and online deployment.
* Organised the website images into an images folder for use throughout the website.
* Improved the consistency of the website's navigation and styling.


[v1.1.0] - 2026-10-23

## Fixed

* Corrected HTML structure issues identified during website improvement.
* Improved navigation links between the website pages.
* Addressed styling consistency issues across the pages.
* Reviewed the website's file organisation to make the project easier to maintain.
* Identified placeholder URLs that need to be replaced with the final published website address.

[v1.1.0] - 2026-10-26

SEO

* Created a sitemap listing the main website pages.
* Added a `robots.txt` file for search engine crawling instructions.
* Added page-specific metadata.
* Prepared canonical URL placeholders for the published website.

### Testing and Deployment

* Continued preparing the project for GitHub and website deployment.
* Identified the need to verify that CSS, JavaScript, images, navigation, and forms work correctly after deployment.
* Identified the need to test the published website on different screen sizes.

### Outstanding Improvements

* Confirm that the original `mtstyle` stylesheet and its styling have been preserved in the final project.
* Add and verify all required doughnut photographs.
* Replace placeholder canonical URLs with the actual website address.
* Verify that the sitemap URLs match the final website structure.
